### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/

### CADASTRAR FUNCIONARIO
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "teste",
    "email": "teste",
    "senha": "teste"
}

### LOGIN FUNCIONÁRIO
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "teste",
    "senha": "teste"
}

### CADASTRAR FORNECEDOR
POST http://localhost:3000/fornecedor
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "nome": "teste",
    "cpf": "123123123123",
    "cnpj": "1231231231230001"
}

### CONSULTAR FORNECEDOR ID
GET http://localhost:3000/fornecedor/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### CONSULTAR FORNECEDOR NOME
GET http://localhost:3000/fornecedor?nome=
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{login.response.body.$.token}}

